      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-13T03:14:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I'm building a character with Struggling, Mystical, and Elemental Manipulator.</p>\n<p>Struggling gives three qualities. Mystical gives another one. That leaves two Quality slots remaining.</p>\n<p>The character has an Elemental/Energy power, so they have three dice to spend still. They assign one die to a power from the Elemental Manipulator list, and are left with two dice that must be assigned to qualities, which would prevent them from also getting a roleplay quality.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Did I mess something up? This seems like something of an oversight, otherwise.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:53.316Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 23,
      "reads": 6,
      "readers_count": 5,
      "score": 116.2,
