      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So I'm building a character with Struggling, Mystical, and Elemental Manipulator.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Struggling gives three qualities. Mystical gives another one. That leaves two Quality slots remaining.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The character has an Elemental/Energy power, so they have three dice to spend still. They assign one die to a power from the Elemental Manipulator list, and are left with two dice that must be assigned to qualities, which would prevent them from also getting a roleplay quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Did I mess something up? This seems like something of an oversight, otherwise.</p>",
