    {
      "id": 231106,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-13T16:50:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Seems like a slight oversight. &nbsp;This could happen with Medical background too as it's the other background to give three dice for qualities. &nbsp;My guess is the main intent is that you didn't pick a elemental/energy power during power source choices. &nbsp; Reason being that&nbsp;the Elemental Manipulator Archetype would have you use one die on that for a power, another on a power from its list, only one die on a quality. &nbsp;The easiest fix from my view is to only give two dice for qualities on the Struggling and Medical backgrounds. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:06:16.795Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
